  m_text: "<b>1. KHAI TH\xC1C:</b> Nh\u1EA5p chu\u1ED9t v\xE0o Tr\u1EE5 Tinh Th\u1EC3
    ho\u1EB7c s\u1EAFm M\xE1y Khoan \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng thu ho\u1EA1ch
    Pha L\xEA.\n\n<b>2. N\xC2NG C\u1EA4P:</b> Gia t\u0103ng Th\u1EC3 L\u1EF1c (HP),
    C\xF4ng K\xEDch (ATK), T\u1ED1c \u0110\xE1nh (SPD) v\xE0 C\u1ED5 Ng\u1EEF cho
    D\u0169ng S\u0129.\n\n<b>3. PH\xD2NG TH\u1EE6:</b> D\u0169ng S\u0129 v\xE0 Tr\u1EE5
    Tinh Th\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\xE1nh lui c\xE1c \u0111\u1EE3t qu\xE1i
    v\u1EADt x\xE2m l\u0103ng.\n\n<b>4. OVERDRIVE:</b> T\xEDch \u0111\u1EE7 100%
    N\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EC3 k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t Cu\u1ED3ng N\u1ED9 x3 S\xE1t Th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    di\u1EC7t Boss!"
